OC_SORT_CPP
https://github.com/Postroggy/OC_SORT_CPP

Vendored into SushiTrack as the reference implementation the regression
harness measures SushiTrack against. It is a C++ port by Yueqi Guo of OC-SORT,
published in Python by Jinkun Cao and others at
https://github.com/noahcao/OC_SORT. The port carries the MIT licence,
reproduced in LICENSE beside this file; OC-SORT itself is MIT as well.

Changed here: the headers were renamed to the .hpp spelling this tree uses
(association.h to Association.hpp, kalmanfilter.h to KalmanFilter.hpp,
OCsort.h to OCSort.hpp, and so on), and CMakeLists.txt was rewritten for this
workspace. The header guards still name the project they came from.
